          "title": "You'll want to know: روزی روزگاری",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "روزی روزگاری (ruzi ruzegâri) — \"once upon a time\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "روزی روزگاری (ruzi ruzegâri) در یک روستای کوچک پیرزنی زندگی میکرد. Ruzi ruzegâri dar yek rustâ-ye kuchak pirzani zendegi mikard. Once upon a time an old woman lived in a little village."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Literally \"one day, in one time\". ruzegâr \"time, age\". The past continuous sets the scene."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ruzi ruzegâri repeats ruz \"day\" in ruzi \"one day\" and ruzegâri \"in one age\", from ruzegâr \"time, age\". EtymDB takes ruz back through Middle Persian to Old Persian rauča-."
            }
          ]
        },
